   "stem_html": "\n    <p>The three given graphs represent the functions <span data-math=\"f\">f</span>, <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>, and <span data-math=\"h\">h</span> defined above.</p>\n<br>    <p><img alt=\"A graph displays three increasing exponential curves, labeled a, b, and c, where 'a' shows the fastest growth and 'c' the slowest.\" height=\"288\" src=\"exercises/media/e33d31cbcc19e808.jpg\" width=\"300\"></p>\n<br><br>    <ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n      <li>Which graph corresponds to <span data-math=\"f(x)\">f(x)</span>?</li>\n    </ol>\n",
